<description>&lt;p&gt;Ambazonian separatists shot a journalist in Bamenda, continuing attacks on civilians in the Anglophone regions. Boko Haram is rebuilding its ranks by training about 8,000 children as new fighters, while women farmers in Gella have resisted the group to rebuild a community. Cameroon is pursuing drones and joint border patrols to secure the Nigeria-Cameroon frontier and has offered the Zina and Makary oil blocks to investors after a twelve-year halt. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNX0Q3VGx6a0NIN210OTNKZVd6SndCOEhIelcteWZ1TTVfZTQzbGtCbVo5NkhuV3JUVmVJZkZSOEFjVDZISTZ1ZkVVdGQ3UVVzaVVkZlhyRVA5ZFNYNjVFUWN2Rzg0TUVicDhGLTlVMFFSelpDam1TdEE3cHhoNXBNc3hOMUtXT0tHM2dDRnNscUhIcktoQWRtSlIzWWpnVlRqR1VvMG1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQU1l5WXBqS0JMNU5uZEFZY2s1UURDQ2N2bDhwSnQxUnlUUjNYVEZQclR6NWh6Sk9yajVUN1JnMHYzYUhNWkxsU01kTm1FSW5NY25keWl2SE00Q2VaWlF6cy1RR3RmS3JNSFVZSVJtX3JBcVFRX1BXUGZ2TG5KTHFhVU5LNVBGcFVVbXNFMUNNek94dDRjUHEweFIteGNYaXJMVWJXOWZfU19zOWR4NHQ4LTRnUnFMd3VsOUxEZ2xtdTAtc3ktYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNMW1GRVZLVWI4YldIeU9wU2l4dzV2Q3J4OWE4Z0J2VkZqQ1FZbWoyN3dpR1gwdFVtbzc1NWUzbmt0QmlORTNlV09EZlVVZWxZbXN6YU5jMHhOZGwtX042aXYyOXF2TDRKcjJVYUF3RUxWdUlHRHRvR3QtbE5kVDlaVWtHMXA0cjdiTzA4d3hn?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQSUIzYUZNQ1dfdm1ZWHAta0xWOW9OZnM5eUgySXJ6MmVuZzloZnBCME9tQ05VTE12TUVqcHE5WFIyTktUSlRoX0hpcFg5ajR2Wk1WOEZMWGNIYkJCQTRjUGx2dFlDRDhrSFB0WC1jY3FjX0NOTlNONEgwaXZZWXJaSW1NRjhqSlBlQ